wecom-payment-reconciliation.timer|required|present|true|true|timer|false|Daily 02:30 UTC.
wecom-backup.service|required|present|true|false|oneshot|false|Daily encrypted DB + media backup (RND-193). #105 owns off-host/offsite DR; this manifest does not change backup cadence/retention/encryption semantics.
