qiniu-ssl-renew@.service|template|present|false|false|template|false|Per-domain Qiniu Kodo CDN custom-domain cert template (instance = domain, e.g. media-origin.crowntime.cn). Not currently instantiated on production (no active qiniu-ssl-renew@<domain>.timer observed in the 2026-08-28 baseline). Distinct from, and not superseded by, the wildcard nginx-facing renewal above — keep both; do not delete this template.
